ports_health", "label": "Rule 5: A driver reports health, does not decide policy", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Never abort, never block forever, never retry in a tight loop"}, {"id": "claude_published_t", "label": "Published<T> slot", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Two buffers, not a seqlock: a seqlock reader preempting its writer on the same core spun forever"}, {"id": "claude_frame", "label": "Frame snapshot", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "claude_core_split", "label": "Core split (core 0 real-time island, core 1 deferrable)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Tach edge to shift lamp must stay under 3 ms; nothing above priority 18 on core 0"}, {"id": "claude_flash_write_freezes_core0", "label": "Flash write freezes core 0", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "IDF suspends the other core's scheduler; P4 has no flash auto-suspend, so flash written only when core::flash::still"}, {"id": "claude_ui_shadow", "label": "ui::Shadow glass copy in PSRAM", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Sends only pixels differing from the shadow; a scrub band per second repairs a panel that lost memory"}, {"id": "claude_widget_damage", "label": "Widget damage partial updates", "file